'''Happy 100''' (ハッピー100; ''Happī 100'') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Crash Fever Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Happy 100
|image = E 321.png
|appearance = [[Crash Fever Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 200¢ - 790¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has low health and attack power, but are usually spammed/are in groups. Their Area Attack and range can make them formidable when buffed though.

